===
title: Ran
---
<<declare $n = 0>>
<<set $n to 1>>
<<if $n == 1>>
    taken
<<else>>
    skipped
<<endif>>
-> right
    <<jump RanEnd>>
-> left
    left
===
title: RanEnd
---
end
<<stop>>
after
